<title>USA: Score Board names president/COO.</title>
<headline>Score Board names president/COO.</headline>
<dateline>CHERRY HILL, N.J. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Score Board Inc said Thursday that John White would become president and chief operating officer, succeeding Barry Bookman, who is leaving to pursue other opportunities.</p>
<p>Bookman has been executive vice president and chief operating officer, according to the Score Board, which markets sports-related products.</p>
<p>White most recently served as chairman, president and chief executive at Outsourcing Partnership. He will retain the title of chairman there.</p>
</text>
